OL,3,GNEWSAI'd swell up once a week - now my
OL,4,Alife has changed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's changed my life. I can do
OL,7,Feverything I want to now. It's
OL,8,Fbrilliant," says Jack Cope.
OL,10,FThe 30-year-old joiner, from Bedford,
OL,11,Fhas had hereditary angioedema (HAE), a
OL,12,Fcondition which causes severe
OL,13,Funpredictable swelling and painful
OL,14,Fattacks, since birth.
OL,16,FThe swelling occurs all over his body,
OL,17,Fincluding in his throat, stomach and
OL,18,Fface. Even something as simple as using
OL,19,Fa hammer can cause his hand to swell.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
